{"metaDescription":"","name":"Where To Send?","metaTitle":"Where To Send?","mobile":"","content":"<h1>Where to Send?</h1>\r\n<div class=\"region region-content\">\r\n<div id=\"block-system-main\" class=\"block block-system\">\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n<div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"field-items\">\r\n<div class=\"field-item even\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica;\">In order to ship quickly and without delays Pleas take close attention on a shipping address. Bellow is a sample how to fill out a shipping address fields. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times;\">Please indicate in name field company name C/O Gzavnili LLC and your first name; also in address line 2- your member number GZ&hellip;. And if you wish that your package were not repacked Please use a following symbol: #0#0#0#.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times;\"><span style=\"font-family: mceinline;\"><span style=\"font-family: mceinline;\"><span style=\"font-family: mceinline;\">We are not responsible for safty of packages delivered by USPS, if parcel not covered with signature required service</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Where to send ?</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">* First Name: <input id=\"edit-name\" class=\"input-small form-text required\" style=\"width: 200px !important;\" maxlength=\"60\" name=\"FirstName\" size=\"5\" type=\"text\" value=\"C/O Gzavnili - \" /> * Last Name: <input id=\"edit-name\" class=\"input-small form-text required\" style=\"width: 200px !important;\" maxlength=\"60\" name=\"LastName\" type=\"text\" value=\"Mr. xSmith\" />&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">* Address Line 1: <input id=\"edit-name\" class=\"input-small form-text required\" style=\"width: 200px !important;\" maxlength=\"60\" name=\"Address1\" size=\"100\" type=\"text\" value=\"1914 Kings Highway 2fl \" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">* Address Line 2 : <input id=\"edit-name\" class=\"input-small form-text required\" style=\"width: 200px !important;\" maxlength=\"60\" name=\"Address2\" size=\"45\" type=\"text\" value=\"GZ NUMBERA\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">* City: <input id=\"edit-name\" class=\"input-small form-text required\" style=\"width: 200px !important;\" maxlength=\"60\" name=\"City\" size=\"15\" type=\"text\" value=\"Brooklyn\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">* State: <select> <option value=\"state\">NY</option></select></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">* Zip Code (5 digit): <input id=\"edit-name\" class=\"input-small form-text required\" maxlength=\"60\" name=\"Zipcode\" size=\"5\" type=\"text\" value=\"11229\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">* Country: <select> <option value=\"state\">USA</option></select></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">* Phone: <input id=\"edit-name\" class=\"input-small form-text required\" maxlength=\"60\" name=\"Phone\" size=\"35\" type=\"text\" value=\"718 676 0022\" /> Other Phone: <input id=\"edit-name\" class=\"input-small form-text required\" maxlength=\"60\" name=\"OtherPhone\" size=\"15\" type=\"text\" /></p>\r\n</div>","header":"Where To Send?","id":41,"groups":[],"url":"/where-to-send.html","metaKeywords":"","type":1}